<title>UK: SOCCER-SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Scottish premier</p>
<p>division soccer matches played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Celtic 2 (O'Neill 43, Di Canio 77 pen) Hearts 2 (Cameron 31,</p>
<p>McCann 64). Halftime 1-1. Attendance 50,034.</p>
<p>Dundee United 1 (Winters 70) Dunfermline 1 (Smith 87). 0-0.</p>
